A thing called switch has
  a boolean called ok is true,
  a boolean called shut.
A thing called panel has
  a switch called main.

To 'describe' of a switch called lamp.
    Print lamp's ok as text.

a switch called origin.
a panel called board.
Print origin's ok as text.
Print origin's shut as text.
Print board's main's ok as text.
a text called word is origin's shut as text.
Print word.
Print "{origin's ok as text}".
'describe' of origin.
a boolean called ready is true.
Print ready as text.
Print origin's ok.
Print origin's shut.
Set origin's ok to false.
Print origin's ok as text.
